 hidden;\n      background:\n        linear-gradient(172deg, transparent 0 38%, rgba(255,255,255,.82) 38.3% 42%, transparent 42.2%),\n        linear-gradient(185deg, transparent 0 57%, rgba(255,237,126,.8) 57.2% 60%, transparent 60.2%),\n        linear-gradient(0deg, #f66a17, #ff8100 52%, #ffbd4d 100%);\n    }\n    .footer::before {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      width: 53%;\n      height: 3px;\n      top: 136px;\n      left: 0;\n      background: #ffe94a;\n      box-shadow: 0 -35px 0 rgba(255,237,74,.8), 0 34px 0 rgba(255,237,74,.7);\n    }\n    @media (max-width: 900px) {\n      .top { height: 290px; }\n      .event { top: 34px; right: 6%; font-size: 13px; }\n      .year { top: 70px; left: 8%; font-size: 57px; }\n      .year span { font-size: 46px; }\n      .subevent { top: 115px; font-size: 14px; right: 5%; }\n      .content { width: 89%; padding-top: 25px; }\n      h1 { font-size: 26px; }\n      h2 { font-size: 25px; }\n      h3 { font-size: 23px; }\n      .presenter { font-size: 17px; }\n      .intro { font-size: 16px; }\n      .equations { width: 94%; font-size: 19px; }\n      .reference-list { font-size: 15px; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <header class=\"top\">\n      <div class=\"event\">中国科学院软件研究所学术年会，2023</div>\n      <div class=\"year\"><span>量子</span>2023</div>\n      <div class=\"subevent\">暨计算机科学国家重点实验室开放课题</div>\n    </header>\n\n    <section class=\"content\">\n      <h1>Uncertainty estimation for quantum</h1>\n      <h2>量子信息前沿论坛</h2>\n      <p class=\"presenter\">陈新宇；王旭；孙皓；周彬</p>\n      <p class=\"presenter\">IEEE Transactions on Information Theory, 2023</p>\n      <p class=\"presenter\">联系方式：chenkai@ios.ac.cn</p>\n\n      <h2>研究背景</h2>\n      <p class=\"intro\">近年来量子计算硬件技术有很大发展，例如超导量子、光量子和离子阱。传统量子设备主流是噪声系统，大多数，随着量子硬件的发展，量子机器的错误率逐渐降低。</p>\n      <p class=\"intro\">量子信道的误差在许多设备中都可以忽略或者没有，被称为理想设备。对于噪声量子设备来说，我们需要估计噪声模型，包括噪声的类型、噪声的大小和噪声的分布。</p>\n      <p class=\"intro\">传统的量子设备噪声模型会影响算法效果。我们的工作目标是对于理想量子设备，量子线路输出的噪声分布进行量化。</p>\n\n      <h2>研究模型</h2>\n      <p class=\"intro\">量子设备可以通过对量子态的复杂变换，将量子态从输入变换为输出。我们定义量子态的概率幅度为 $a$，量子态的密度矩阵为 $\\rho$。</p>\n      <p class=\"intro\">对于一个量子线路，输入为量子态 $\\rho$，输出为测量结果。我们通过对输出结果的统计，得到量子线路的估计结果。</p>\n\n      <div class=\"equations\">\n        理想量子线路<br>\n        $\\rho(\\epsilon^{-2})^{*}\\qquad \\rho(\\sqrt{d}\\cdot\\epsilon^{-2})$<br>\n        噪声量子线路<br>\n        $\\rho(\\epsilon^{-2})^{*}\\qquad \\rho(\\sqrt{d}+\\epsilon^{-2})^{*}$\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"intro\">我们的主要目标是研究理想量子线路和噪声量子线路的差异，并且给出量子线路中采样的复杂度。</p>\n\n      <h2>参考文献</h2>\n      <ol class=\"reference-list\">\n        <li>D. Aharonov, J. Cotler, and X. L. Qi, “Quantum algorithmic measurement,” <i>Communications</i>, vol. 13, no. 1, pp. 1–9, 2022.</li>\n        <li>S. Chen, J. Cotler, H.-Y. Huang, and J. E. “Exponential separations between learning with and without quantum memory,” <i>IEEE Foundations of Computer Science</i> (FOCS 2021), pp. 574–585.</li>\n        <li>A. Montanaro and R. de Wolf, “A survey of quantum property testing,” <i>Computing, Graduate Surveys</i>, vol. 7, pp. 1–81, 2016.</li>\n      </ol>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer class=\"footer\"></footer>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
